        {
          "unit_index": 69,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 24,
          "text": "__MOST_HIGH_A__ 来帮助他的百群姓过。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 82,
          "verse": 20,
          "content_chars": 24,
          "text": "翰“施洗约 __PERSON_C__ 打发我个们来问你："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 92,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "了位盲人看见，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 96,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "死人名复活，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 101,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 33,
          "text": "__PERSON_F__ 众人谈论就开着始向 __PERSON_C__ ："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 108,
          "verse": 25,
          "content_chars": 17,
          "text": "那穿华丽衣服、过奢侈生活人都在王宫里。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 113,
          "verse": 26,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "他位不只是着个先知。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 117,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 1,
          "text": "’[b]"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 120,
          "verse": 28,
          "content_chars": 18,
          "text": "没有比 __PERSON_C__ 更大个；"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 130,
          "verse": 31,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "“那么了位，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 131,
          "verse": 31,
          "content_chars": 11,
          "text": "这世代人该比作着什么呢？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 136,
          "verse": 32,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "你们却不跳舞；"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 138,
          "verse": 32,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "你们了却不哭名泣。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 146,
          "verse": 34,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "罪人朋友是税吏和。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 150,
          "verse": 36,
          "content_chars": 21,
          "text": "36 利赛人请有一法 __PERSON_F__ 吃饭，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 151,
          "verse": 36,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "他进着法家利赛人的，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 152,
          "verse": 36,
